:: day-1_gardens_hub [nobr]
<<locationImage "royal_gardens" "Royal Gardens">>
<h2>🌿 Royal Gardens</h2>
<p>Dusk again. The jasmine is covered tonight   frost warning.</p>

<<completeObjective "gardens_wynn">>

<<if $d2_npc_wynn and not $d1_npc_wynn2>>
