  <<npcPortrait "wynn" "Old Wynn">>
  <h4>🌹 Old Wynn Covering the Roses</h4>
  <p>Burlap over the beds. His hands move like he's done this a thousand winters running.</p>
  [[Approach|day-1_npc_wynn2]]
</div>
<</if>>

<<if not $d2_npc_wynn or $d1_npc_wynn2>>
  <p class="empty-note">The garden is cold and quiet, wrapped against the frost.</p>
<</if>>

